#: source/command-ref/files/manifest.json.md:1
msgid "`manifest.json`"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/manifest.json.md:3
msgid ""
"The manifest file records the provenance of the packages that are installed "
"in a [profile](./profiles.md) managed by [`nix profile`](../../command-ref/"
"new-cli/nix3-profile.md) (experimental)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/manifest.json.md:5
msgid ""
"Here is an example of what the file might look like after installing `zoom-"
"us` from Nixpkgs:"
msgstr ""

